  }
}

message.content:
The dispatcher retries on a fixed 5s timer with no cap, so a dead endpoint gets a request every 5 seconds forever. I'll switch to capped exponential backoff with full jitter:

```js
const delay = Math.min(30 * 60_000, 5_000 * 2 ** attempt);
const jittered = Math.random() * delay;
```

and drop the event to a dead-letter queue after 8 attempts (~21 minutes worst case). Writing the change now.

